      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "id": "title",
      "top": -230,
      "left": -60,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "Habitat Health Monitor – full bench circuit (simulated): two microcontrollers and a hub. Simulated parts are labelled."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "id": "label_uno",
      "top": -20,
      "left": -60,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "Arduino UNO R3: runs firmware/exercise-uno here (with wokwi_twin.h)"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "id": "label_dht",
      "top": -160,
      "left": 60,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "DHT11 stand-in (simulated) DHT22: D2 → cabin_temp, cabin_rh (node cabin-1), estimate"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "id": "label_buzzer",
      "top": -95,
      "left": 360,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "Alarm buzzer (passive): D8 ← hub command"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "id": "label_esp",
      "top": -60,
      "left": 900,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "tilt-1 node: ESP32 stands in for the NodeMCU (simulated). Drawn here, runs in its own twin: https://wokwi.com/projects/480680478751478785"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "id": "label_switch",
      "top": 0,
      "left": 1160,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "KY-017 stand-in (simulated): pin 1 = + (3V3), middle = S (D5 / GPIO14), pin 3 = − (GND). Slide right = tilted."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "id": "label_pack",
      "top": 262,
      "left": 960,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "4×AA Ni-MH pack (drawing only, 4.8–5.6 V): + → VIN, − → GND"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "id": "label_hub",
      "top": 40,
      "left": 330,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "Raspberry Pi 3 Model B hub (circuit abstraction): Wokwi has no Pi 3, so this chip does the hub's job on the UNO link: it reads cabin-1, judges it against NASA-STD-3001 and logs it; its alert control sends the alarm. Mosquitto, console and Mars link run on the real Pi."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "id": "label_header",
      "top": 230,
      "left": 400,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "40-pin header: EMPTY: nothing wired here"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "id": "label_power",
      "top": 252,
      "left": 400,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "Pi power: micro-USB 5 V 2.5 A in. microSD: Raspberry Pi OS 64-bit"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "id": "label_usb",
      "top": 150,
      "left": 300,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "USB cable, Pi USB-A ↔ UNO USB-B: USB serial 250000 → /dev/ttyACM0. Drawn as the UNO's UART (TX D1 → hub RX blue, hub TX → RX D0 orange), which the UNO's USB bridge feeds."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "id": "label_wifi",
      "top": 190,
      "left": 400,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "- - - Wi-Fi 2.4 GHz → MQTT :1883 (Mosquitto on the Pi) - - -"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "id": "flow_1",
      "top": 380,
      "left": -60,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "Data flow: UNO → USB serial → hub → NASA-STD-3001 rules → crew console"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "id": "flow_2",
      "top": 402,
      "left": -60,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "tilt-1 → Wi-Fi → MQTT → hub. Hub → simulated Mars link (light-time delay, blackouts) → Earth page"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "id": "rules_1",
      "top": 436,
      "left": -60,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "Rules: nothing on the Pi header; never the cell pack and USB at once; mercury pod sealed, adults only"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "id": "rules_2",
      "top": 458,
      "left": -60,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "Simulated parts are labelled. Readings are estimates. Educational prototype, not a medical device."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "chip-bmp280",
      "id": "baro",
      "top": 250,
      "left": 60,
      "attrs": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "id": "label_baro",
      "top": 330,
      "left": -60,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "BMP280 (simulated chip, I2C 0x76): 3.3V, A4 SDA, A5 SCL → cabin_p hPa (node cabin-1). Never 5V."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "id": "label_baro_esp",
      "top": -40,
      "left": 900,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "tilt-1 also carries a BMP280 on D2/D1 → cabin_p (drawn, not simulated here)"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "id": "label_cabin2",
      "top": 330,
      "left": 900,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "cabin-2: a second ESP32 on the bench with a BMP280 on GPIO21/GPIO22 → cabin_p over Wi-Fi/MQTT (drawn, not simulated here)"
      }
    }
